&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: left"&gt;GRAPHTEC ASIA PACIFIC CO.,LTD.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 2px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;Graphtec Europe B.V.&lt;/p&gt;
